second ingestion identifies duplicate

third ingestion identifies duplicate

stored row count remains one

metrics remain unchanged

Do not call hashing alone idempotency.

# 34. SQLite

Use SQLite as the DE-01 local relational execution and test engine.

SQLite is not the future production datastore.

Explicitly enable foreign key enforcement for every relevant connection:

PRAGMA foreign_keys = ON

Do not rely on SQLite default behavior.

Where appropriate, validate relational integrity in tests using foreign key checks.

Do not add PostgreSQL during DE-01.

